ely known as  the dark triad  and began to eliminate all the different  members of the royal family  with their devil magic making them  almost impossible to defeat  that being said though since yuno's  birth there was a guy called ralph  who was given the responsibility of  protecting him rael's family had served  yuna's family  for generations and his father was  captain of the spake kingdom's magic  defense force  as the dark triad was killing off all  the different royals ralph's father took  uno  and fled into the strong magic region  what was especially terrifying about  this moment  was that ralph senior and yuno were just  meters away from being killed by xenon  who to me is the most terrifying member  of the dark triad  if it wasn't for these two guys right  here who intervened  it's highly likely that yuno never would  have survived  like i alluded to earlier the strong  magic region itself  is incredibly dangerous so for ralph's  dad to successfully travel across it  with a baby in hand  super super impressive stuff once they  made it to the edge of the clover  kingdom  ralph senior used the last of his  strength to leave yuno outside this  church  in hajj village alongside his magic  stone  this village is a poor area located in  the forsaken realm of the clover kingdom  and most people there have very little  magic power and  few opportunities beyond farming on that  same day  it just so happened that astor was also  abandoned outside the church  directly next to the young spake kingdom  prince  and in the anime their names were  written in similar writing  which has many many implications i mean  to me it makes it look like they were  brought by the same person  but as you can see ralph was only  carrying one uh one child  so i don't know exactly how aster ended  up there yet  but i'm sure we will find out soon  enough the two of them grew up together  as brothers  and shared the same birthday which from  their perspective their birthday is the  day that they were found  at the church during their childhood  yoona was incredibly timid  and he would just cry at minor  inconveniences and was genuinely fearful  of the world around him  that said his attitude first began to  change when he heard the story  of the first wizard king which if you've  watched black clover you've probably  seen that story  at least a hundred times i know i have  youno was both intrigued by the story  and also by astor's crazy declaration to  become the next wizard king  at this time hajj village had never had  one of its residents become a magic  knight so to claim to become the wizard  king who you know commands all the magic  knight squads that's a pretty  bold thing to say many months later hajj  village was running out of food and yuno  was given the sole responsibility  to deliver a letter to a neighboring  village asking for supplies  and after successfully delivering the  letter he was attacked by a drunk guy on  the way back  who wanted to steal and then sell his  magic stone  whilst yuno attempted to get it back he  was pretty much powerless against this  grown man  and yeah he was if if no one had  intervened he likely would have lost  the magic stone lucky for him though  astor realized that yuno had been gone  for quite a while  and so he went to kind of investigate  and once he showed up  he managed to get the stone back just  through sheer persistence  in the process astor got pretty beaten  up but he reaffirmed his desire to  become the wizard king  so that poor people in the forsaken  realm would never have to worry about  things like food or money ever again  and also just to prove to people that  anybody can become the wizard king if  they put the work in  this moment is what inspired you spirit  and gave him the resolve to try and  become the next wizard king himself  and also gave him the resolve to never  cry again which i don't know if that's  healthy but you know it's what he wanted  to do  because they both now had the same goal  and obviously only one of them can be  the wizard king  from that point forward they became  official rivals i guess  the manga shows us how a young youno  spent tons of time practicing with his  win magic  whilst also secretly keeping tabs on  astor's progress  as a consequence of this rivalry unit's  personality  drastically changed over the years from  a timid crybaby  to a person who's unfazed by most things  and just has supreme confidence that he  can overcome  anything and anyone his level of skill  is equal to that of royalty  if not greater but as we know now you  know he does come from spade kingdom  royalty so it all makes sense  but with that said that was the full  backstory  of you know grim burial i hope i'm  hoping i'm saying that last name right  because i've never actually said it out  loud until this video  but yeah that was his backstory if  you've not seen black clover and you're  kind of interested in this character  then i would definitely recommend  picking up the series either the manga  or the anime  and you can learn all about him you know  this was just explaining what happened  before  we meet him in the anime so if you want  to know everything else then check it  out i would recommend it  let me know down below which topics you  might like to see me cover from black  clover  and until the next one peace out
 

